{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>Behold [cruel].</b> The yod of אכזרי is additional, like the internal yud <small>(1 Kings 6:27)</small>:" "<b>To make.</b> The land of the Chaldeans:"], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {0 "The Hebrew differentiates י\"וד (spelled yod-vav-dalet) referring to the letter yud as a grammatical unit, from a plain י the letter name; rendered uniformly as 'yud.'"}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:53:37.378256890Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}